      "evidence": "HYPOTHESIS", "origin": "RECONSTRUCTED_ORIGINAL", "quality_status": "REVIEW_REQUIRED",
      "notes": "Analogieschluss aus MC10/MC12 (Existenz -> NIEDRIG), ungetestet."
